cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use the indian_banking domain, please cite this benchmark together with
  the tau2-bench and tau-bench papers it builds on.
title: "TauIndianBankBench: an Indian retail-banking benchmark for tool-using conversational agents"
abstract: >-
  A tau2-bench domain in which a conversational agent staffs the chat desk of an
  India-based retail bank: 1000 tasks across 50 families, 34 tools, a written
  bank policy and a 24-document knowledge base. Episodes are scored strictly on
  the final database state and on the required tool actions.
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/npci/TauIndianBankBench"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2026-08-30"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - tau2-bench
  - conversational agents
  - tool use
  - benchmark
  - banking
